  <arrangement id="71445b41e3807c257b8f4fb77ab59ed9">
    <head>Arrangement</head>
<p>Original order, as received. Primarily alphabetical by organization name or personal name.</p>  </arrangement>
  <scopecontent id="8fc7bde37981d76528b9614cb7afdceb">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>David Rockefeller's office files and correspondence documenting his personal activities pertaining to organizations and associations following his retirement as Chair of Chase Bank. Mr. Rockefeller began to significantly curtail his activities around 2005 following his ninetieth birthday.</p>  </scopecontent>
